      "speaker": "Mom",
      "text": "Can you get the milk and eggs?",
      "start_ms": 250,
      "end_ms": 2934,
      "ko": "우유랑 달걀 좀 가져다줄래?"
    },
    {
      "idx": 1,
      "speaker": "Max",
      "text": "Which milk do we need?",
      "start_ms": 3484,
      "end_ms": 5566,
      "ko": "어떤 우유가 필요해요?"
    },
    {
      "idx": 2,
      "speaker": "Mom",
      "text": "The big one with the blue cap.",
      "start_ms": 6116,
      "end_ms": 8969,
      "ko": "파란 뚜껑 있는 큰 거."
    },
    {
